  "question": {
    "text": "Let $\\Delta=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\\sin \\theta \\cos \\phi & \\sin \\theta \\sin \\phi & \\cos \\theta \\\\ \\cos \\theta \\cos \\phi & \\cos \\theta \\sin \\phi & -\\sin \\theta \\\\ -\\sin \\theta \\sin \\phi & \\sin \\theta \\cos \\phi & 0\\end{array}\\right|$. Then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "3lAZS",
      "text": "$\\Delta$ is independent of $\\theta$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "F7PrL",
      "text": "$\\Delta$ is independent of $\\varphi$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "T68pP",
      "text": "$\\Delta$ is a constant",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "IVe01",
      "text": "$\\left(\\frac{d \\Delta}{d \\theta}\\right)_{\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=0$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\Delta=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\\sin \\theta \\cos \\phi & \\sin \\theta \\sin \\phi & \\cos \\theta \\\\ \\cos \\theta \\cos \\phi & \\cos \\theta \\sin \\phi & -\\sin \\theta \\\\ -\\sin \\theta \\sin \\phi & \\sin \\theta \\cos \\phi & 0\\end{array}\\right|$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{C}_1 \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{C}_1-\\left(\\frac{\\cos \\phi}{\\sin \\phi}\\right) \\mathrm{C}_2 \\Rightarrow \\Delta=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\n0 & \\sin \\theta \\sin \\phi & \\cos \\theta \\\\\n0 & \\cos \\theta \\sin \\phi & -\\sin \\theta \\\\\n-\\frac{\\sin \\theta}{\\sin \\phi} & \\sin \\theta \\cos \\phi & \\theta\n\\end{array}\\right| \\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sin \\theta}{\\sin \\phi} \\cdot \\sin \\phi\\left(\\cos ^2 \\theta+\\sin ^2 \\theta\\right)= \\sin \\theta \\rightarrow \\text { Independent of } \\phi \\\\\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d} \\Delta}{\\mathrm{d} \\theta}=\\left.\\cos \\theta \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\mathrm{d} \\Delta}{\\mathrm{d} \\theta}\\right|_{\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=0\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
